	(text_box "Isolation:\n\nOutput 1 - 2 are Isolated from each other and the logic\n\nInput 1 - 3 are Isolated from each other and the logic\n\n24V Field supply is isolated from logic but powers isolated sides of RS485\n\nRatings:\n\nOutput 1 - 2: ≤ 30 V DC, 100mA, dry contact OptoMOS outputs\n\nInput 1 - 3: IEC 61131-2, Type 3 Sinking inputs"
